== 5. from n to X ==
   min over n in 8..20000 of [2^(3n/4)/(n^(9/2) ln n)] / [X^(3/4)/(ln X)^5] (worst X in [2^(n+1), 2^(n+2))) = 0.10691 at n = 25
   (the ratio grows like sqrt(ln X)/ln ln X, so (log X)^5 is a valid, slightly lossy, exponent; (log X)^(9/2) log log X is exact)
   x(0) = 1, x(1) = 3: for 3 <= X < 2^9 the count #{x(h) <= X} >= 2 > 0, so c can be adjusted

